---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Prashant Shah">
  <section class="pt-8 pb-20">
    <h1 class="text-5xl leading-tight mb-4" transition:name="page-title">
      Prashant Shah
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-[var(--color-muted)] max-w-[520px] mb-10">
      I build software that works for the people using it.
    </p>

    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[0.95rem] text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-8">
      <li>Built production systems at Trimble and Novartis</li>
      <li>Research: emotion-aware retrieval with knowledge graphs</li>
      <li>Graduating May 2026</li>
    </ul>

    <a
      href="/resume.pdf"
      class="inline-block text-sm font-heading font-medium text-[var(--color-accent)] no-underline border border-[var(--color-accent)] rounded px-4 py-2 hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-white transition-colors duration-150"
    >
      Download Resume
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-16 pb-8">
    <h2 class="text-2xl mb-10">Selected Work</h2>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-lg mb-1">
          <a href="/work" class="no-underline text-[var(--color-text)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            The Canvas Agent
          </a>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)]">
          A tool-calling AI agent over LMS data with 9 typed tools, parameterized SQL, and persistent memory via pgvector. Won HackRamapo.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-lg mb-1">
          <a href="/work" class="no-underline text-[var(--color-text)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            Trimble
          </a>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)]">
          Production configuration management platform in C#/.NET and Azure for a distributed broker architecture.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3 class="text-lg mb-1">
          <a href="/research" class="no-underline text-[var(--color-text)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            The Research
          </a>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-muted)]">
          What happens when user intent contradicts content semantics? Resolving affective conflict in retrieval with knowledge graphs.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-12 pb-4">
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      <span class="font-heading font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">Currently:</span>
      Finishing up research and looking for full-time roles starting Summer 2026.
      <a href="/now" class="ml-1">See what I'm up to</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
